<title>LATVIA: Latvia yields slide at Treasury bill auction.</title>
<headline>Latvia yields slide at Treasury bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of Latvian T-bills fell at an auction of 28-day and three month paper on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct) LAST WEEK NO OF BANKS ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> One month    4.06	  4.40	 7	   0.50  2.13   0.50</p>
<p> Three-month  5.13	  5.47	 6	   1.0   2.8    1.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
